 ### SCENARIO-PHASE4-042
 **Description:** Running Exp 4070 either writes `blocked_arc_env_unreachable` when the ARC SDK live catalog precondition fails, writes `complete: ninth_game_no_solve_<game>_<reason>` when the selected new target does not advance a level, or writes `success: ninth_game_solved_<game>_at_action_N` only when the live environment reports a level counter increment after the verified action plan. A successful run MUST select `ft09-0d8bbf25` from the current survey/baseline set after strict non-spatial candidates are exhausted, set `game_solved=true`, set `target_game="ft09-0d8bbf25"`, set `real_env_confirmed=true`, set `total_games_solved=9`, record positive exploration actions before induction, preserve the observe -> explore -> induce -> verify -> act trace with induction calls for Exp 4072 transfer analysis, and include principle notes for the monotonic counter, real-environment confirmation, and solve-trace fields.
+
+### REQ-PHASE4-043: ARC-AGI-3 Verifier Action-Pruner Efficiency Ablation
+**Description:** The system SHALL run Exp 4071 as a with-versus-without GAP-4 verifier action-pruning ablation over 3-5 real-env-confirmed solved ARC-AGI-3 game traces. It MUST first check whether the ARC environment is reachable and stop with `honest_verdict="blocked_arc_env_unreachable"` when live replay is required but unavailable. When live replay cannot be used but recorded solved traces are available, it MUST explicitly declare the offline replay substrate and replay the same seed and action budget for both arms. The baseline arm MUST execute explore-first candidate actions without verifier pruning; the pruned arm MUST score each candidate action against the induced mechanic or goal predicate, reject verifier-inconsistent actions before execution, and choose from surviving candidates. The terminal artifact `results/experiment_4071_verifier_action_pruner_efficiency.json` MUST include bare top-level fields `honest_verdict`, `games_evaluated`, `actions_baseline_mean`, `actions_pruned_mean`, `action_reduction_pct`, `solverate_baseline`, `solverate_pruned`, `solverate_parity_held`, `wallclock_reduction_pct`, and `inference_substrate`.
+
+### SCENARIO-PHASE4-043
+**Description:** Running Exp 4071 either writes `blocked_arc_env_unreachable` when neither live replay nor recorded solved traces can support the ablation, writes `success: verifier_pruner_cuts_actions_<X>pct_equal_solverate` only when the pruned arm reduces mean actions while preserving solve-rate parity, writes `complete: verifier_pruner_no_efficiency_gain` when solve-rate parity holds without positive action reduction, or writes `complete: verifier_pruner_regressed_solverate` when the positive-control parity check fails. A valid artifact MUST evaluate 3-5 solved games, set `solverate_parity_held` as a bare boolean, set `inference_substrate="offline_arc_agi3_verifier_action_pruning_ablation"`, and include principle annotations explaining that action reduction is the north-star efficiency datum and solve-rate parity is the positive control.
